{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29136","headline":"寄阳陵处士 · 许浑","name":"寄阳陵处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧隐青山紫桂阴，一书迢遰寄归心。\n谢公楼上晚花盛，杨子宅前春草深。\n吴岫雨来溪鸟浴，楚江云暗岭猨吟。\n野人宁忆沧洲畔，会待吹嘘定至音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}